{"seq":28,"trial_id":"v04-transfer-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-mu-v04-rehearsal/rx-06-wv2db9/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T15:14:20.207Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"0d1ddeefd24f0f19a465acc52e2b6d7137007d5a67b4042692152d58712e137d","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04TRA0001","text":"Hi Linnea, here's what I found for Sablehithe Paper Mill (SPM, a Canyon account owned by Sebastien Keldale):\n\n• Renewal date: the next renewal is December 10, 2026, according to Moss's Canyon digest from 9/3. That's earlier than the January 20, 2027 date you mentioned from memory in #sierra-team. If it matters for the file, Sebastien can confirm it.\n• Main contact: Lysander Vesfield, Transportation Manager at Sablehithe Paper Mill, leads the Indigo rollout on their side. That's from the Canyon cheat sheet, updated 9/28.","thread_ts":"1792245600.000131"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04TRA0001","ts":"1792245600.000132","thread_ts":"1792245600.000131"}}
